  "title": "Dad&#39;s Banana Nut Bread",
  "description": "Very ripe bananas add a wonderful sweetness to this family favorite. Add whatever nuts you have on hand to personalize this breakfast treat.",
  "authors": [
    "tjmallick"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:47:08-04:00",
